{
  "name": "idle-pokemon-client",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Cliente Desktop Multi-Contas para Idle Pokemon",
  "main": "main.js",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/muurder/idle-pokemon-client.git"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "start": "electron .",
    "dist": "electron-builder --win --publish never",
    "release": "electron-builder --win --publish always"
  },
  "_comentario_files": [
    "A lista 'files' abaixo e a fronteira de seguranca real deste projeto:",
    "um .exe do Electron e so um zip -- 'npx @electron/asar extract' abre",
    "tudo que estiver empacotado. Por isso e ALLOWLIST, arquivo por arquivo,",
    "e nao um '**/*' generico."
  ],
  "build": {
    "appId": "com.idlepokemon.client",
    "productName": "Idle Pokemon Client",
    "electronVersion": "30.0.0",
    "asar": true,
    "win": {
      "target": [
        "nsis"
      ],
      "icon": "logo.ico"
    },
    "nsis": {
      "oneClick": true,
      "perMachine": false
    },
    "publish": {
      "provider": "github",
      "owner": "muurder",
      "repo": "idle-pokemon-client"
    },
    "files": [
      "main.js",
      "preload.js",
      "index.html",
      "styles.css",
      "shell/shell.gerado.js",
      "scripts/dist/game-injector.js",
      "logo.png",
      "logo.ico",
      "package.json"
    ]
  },
  "keywords": [
    "idle-pokemon",
    "multi-client",
    "electron"
  ],
  "author": "Comunidade Idle Pokemon",
  "license": "MIT",
  "devDependencies": {
    "electron": "^30.0.0",
    "electron-builder": "^26.0.0"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "electron-updater": "^6.8.9"
  }
}
